PORTABLE GUIDANCE (NOT RETESTED FROM THIS EXTRACTED KIT)
Use a compatible Linux/Python environment with NumPy and Pillow. From the extracted kit root:
python -m pip install --target inference/runtime --no-deps ncnn==1.0.20250916
curl -fL -o official_models_bundle.zip https://github.com/xinntao/Real-ESRGAN/releases/download/v0.2.5.0/realesrgan-ncnn-vulkan-20220424-ubuntu.zip
unzip official_models_bundle.zip 'models/realesrgan-x4plus-anime.*' -d inference
python inference/run_isolated.py "$PWD/native_floor.png" "$PWD/ai_upscale"
LANTERN_AI_RUNTIME="$PWD/inference" python inference/check_scene_seams.py "$PWD"
To reproduce hero review images, set review_config.json's hero_source to the absolute path of references/hero_original.png, then:
python inference/build_scene_review.py "$PWD"
The scripts accept the scene folder/source paths, but other operating systems, Python versions and architectures were not tested. Several GB of process memory are required. Matching completed tiles can be resumed; source/config hash prevents accidental cross-source reuse.

Large outputs, comparison images, runtime/model binaries and intermediate tiles are excluded from this kit. They are delivered separately. metrics/separate_output_manifest.json hashes those separately delivered outputs; kit_manifest.json hashes included files. Sources are never overwritten by the inference scripts.
